  "bodyTextSample": "Skip to content Cart A NEW ERA OF CAMPING IS HERE Whether its your first trip or you're a seasoned camper, our favourite trips are just around the corner.They are the one that takes the least effort, the one that you can go last minute, and the one you can abandon easily when the weather turns bad. Don't go far, just go anywhere. Shop Now Matilda Swag Vendor: TILDA (5) 5 total reviews Regular price $599.99 AUD Add To Cart Rosie Swag Vendor: TILDA (6) 6 total reviews Regular price $599.99 AUD Add To Cart Recliner Chair Vendor: TILDA (3) 3 total reviews Regular price $189.99 AUD Add To Cart Rosie Butterfly Chair Vendor: TILDA Regular price $129.99 AUD Add To Cart Matilda Butterfly Chair - PRE ORDER: expected mid SEP Vendor: TILDA Regular price $129.99 AUD Add To Cart A Girls Guide to Roadtripping - eBook Vendor: TILDA Regular price $25.00 AUD Add To Cart Camp Towel Vendor: TILDA (4) 4 total reviews Regular price $69.99 AUD Choose options Tilda Cap Vendor: TILDA (3) 3 total reviews Regular price $45.00 AUD Choose options Sale Tilda Beanie Vendor: TILDA (1) 1 total reviews Regular price $45.00 AUD Sale price $35.00 AUD Add To Cart Sold out Sticker Pack Vendor: TILDA Regular price $15.00 AUD Sold out Tilda Graphic Tee Vendor: TILDA Regular price $59.95 AUD Choose options Sale Tilda Relax Hoodie Vendor: TILDA Regular price $99.95 AUD Sale price $79.95 AUD Choose options Gift Card Vendor: TILDA Regular price From $25.00 AUD Choose options Sold out The Dahlia Rug Vendor: SALTY AURA Regular price $177.00 AUD Sold out Sold out The Cungelella Rug Vendor: SALTY AURA Regular price $177.00 AUD Sold out Hanging Camp Organiser - PRE ORDER Vendor: TILDA Regular price $139.99 AUD Choose options 1 / of 16 Camping gear for the girls, by the girls! Tilda is your one stop shop for female-first camping gear and advice. With our signature swags, camping chairs and accessories, we make outdoor adventures more accessible, safe, and empowering for women. Sit Back & Relax!